		{
			dependencies: ["04F4E4AC7E4E64B8"]
			description: [
				"Your first order of business should be getting your hands on some special plants. The easiest one to find is sage, as it can be found while breaking grass as you would wheat. The rest however grow in the mulch and decay of swamps, so they will prove a little harder to obtain."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Luckily, witches have a way to circumvent this problem. It's possible to create a tool called a dwosing rod, capable of locating either a swamp or a jungle. By simply shift right-clicking, the rod will change target to either biome, and the leaves will change color from green to red depending on whether or not you're looking in the direction of a nearby valid biome."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			icon: "hexerei:belladonna_plant"
			id: "00A097E157CBE414"
			rewards: [{
				id: "51CFD01B4EF4B45D"
