		{
			dependencies: ["00A097E157CBE414"]
			description: ["Now that you  have collected yourself some plants for your wicked garden, it's time to get to making some early tools. A drying rack for all the plants you've gathered and, of course, your very own cauldron, will suffice. Of course, remember to provide your new cauldron some heat!"]
