		{
			dependencies: ["0DE859FC67B72DF5"]
			description: ["Occasionally you may come across an owl in the woods. These birds have a great sense of direction and possess extraordinary strength for their size, making them perfect couriers for the needs of two long-distance witches. Simply throwing some cod or salmon to the ground will get them tamed."]
